# 默认排除，只发送构建所需的源码；外置配置、数据和本机资料不进上下文。
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pom.xml
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
!web/
!web/**

# 源码目录内也不能混入本机配置、凭据或产物。
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/target
**/target/**
**/dist
**/dist/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
!web/.env.development
!web/.env.production
**/.npmrc
**/application-local.*
**/application-*.local.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/database/**
**/data/**
**/uploads/**
**/logs/**
**/backup/**
**/backups/**
**/ext-resources/**
**/temp/**
**/output/**
**/coverage/**
**/test-results/**
**/playwright-report/**
**/.cache/**
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.mv.db
**/*.trace.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.dump
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tgz
**/data-backup.json
